    <section id="system-architecture">
      <title>System architecture</title>
      <table id="spec-table" outputclass="spec"><tgroup cols="3"><colspec colname="c1"/><colspec colname="c2"/><colspec colname="c3"/><thead><row><entry>Specification</entry><entry>Value</entry><entry>Unit</entry></row></thead><tbody>
<row><entry>Number of chips per pod</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-chips-per-pod"/></entry><entry></entry></row>
<row><entry>Peak compute per chip (BF16)</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-peak-bf16"/></entry><entry>TFLOPs</entry></row>
<row><entry>Peak compute per chip (FP8)</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-peak-fp8"/></entry><entry>TFLOPs</entry></row>
<row><entry>HBM capacity per chip</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-hbm-capacity"/></entry><entry>GiB</entry></row>
<row><entry>HBM bandwidth per chip</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-hbm-bandwidth"/></entry><entry>GBps</entry></row>
<row><entry>Bidirectional ICI bandwidth per chip</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-ici-bandwidth"/></entry><entry>GBps</entry></row>
<row><entry>DCN bandwidth per chip</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-dcn-per-chip"/></entry><entry>Gbps</entry></row>
<row><entry>Interconnect topology</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-topology"/></entry><entry></entry></row>
</tbody></tgroup></table>
      <p>The largest single slice is <keyword keyref="v5p-max-slice"/> (<keyword keyref="v5p-max-slice-chips"/> chips). Multislice training scales to <keyword keyref="v5p-multislice-max"/> chips.</p>
